<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 900 million pound.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 900 million pound.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 900 million pounds for auction on December 2 and issue on December 3, when 182-day bills worth 929.450 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 10.187 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
